{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Monthly GST (Goods & Services Tax) collections for India, sourced from CBIC monthly press releases (mirrored by PIB and the GST Council). Each row carries the headline gross-collection number plus the CGST / SGST / IGST / cess split, the domestic-vs-imports breakdown, and the year-on-year growth percentage reported in the same release. All monetary values are in INR crore.",
    "source_authority": "CBIC monthly press release on the 1st of every month (e.g. April 2025 collection is published 1 May 2025). Mirrors: pib.gov.in/PressReleseDetailm.aspx, gstcouncil.gov.in/press-release, cbic-gst.gov.in. The PIB / GST Council web fronts render via client-side JavaScript and are not directly scrape-friendly; this seed captures the canonical numeric layout so flowtracker can populate the DB without a headless browser. Live re-fetch is available via GSTClient.fetch_month(period, source_url=...) for any analyst-supplied URL.",
    "format_notes": [
      "period is the COLLECTION month in YYYY-MM (April 2025 → '2025-04'), not the release month.",
      "All *_cr fields are in INR crore (1 crore = 10 million).",
      "gross_collection_cr = cgst_cr + sgst_cr + igst_cr + cess_cr (rounding-tolerant).",
      "domestic_cr + imports_cr = gross_collection_cr (rounding-tolerant).",
      "growth_yoy_pct is the headline YoY growth as published by CBIC in the same release; can be recomputed from the seed via store.get_gst_yoy_series().",
      "source_url is null for older periods where the original PIB URL is no longer guaranteed-resolvable; rows still trace to the CBIC monthly press release for that month."
    ],
    "last_updated": "2026-05-26"
  },
